+    "stable MiniQuake FPS window title",
+    "audio loop length hoists",
+    "audio cost analysis"
+  ],
+  "notes": [
+    "No visual or protocol compatibility threshold was relaxed.",
+    "Fullscreen remains available explicitly; windowed remains the default.",
+    "The disconnected icon remains available for stale established remote connections."
+  ]
+}
